OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment names Great British
OL,4,ARailways chair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chairman of Barclays Bank UK, Sir
OL,7,FJohn Kingman, has been appointed chair
OL,8,Fof Great British Railways (GBR), the
OL,9,Fgovernment has announced.
OL,11,FHis selection comes after it was
OL,12,Frevealed the headquarters for GBR will
OL,13,Fbe built on the former Duckworth
OL,14,FSquare, next to the Vaillant Live
OL,15,Fentertainment venue, in Derby city
OL,16,Fcentre.
OL,18,FGBR will bring responsibility for
OL,19,Ftracks and trains under a single
OL,20,Forganisation for the first time since
OL,21,Fprivatisation in the mid-1990s.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
