OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment names Great British
OL,4,ARailways chair
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir John said: "It is a privilege to be
OL,7,Finvolved in rail's next chapter, making
OL,8,Fsure that public ownership of the
OL,9,Frailways delivers change that people
OL,10,Fcan see."
